{"step_index":1411,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:55:15Z","thinking":"Identified a direct match for \"나래바람\" in the dataset: the registration year and month are identical. The provided location \"부산광역시 남구\" is present, though the dataset contains more specific address details.\n\n\nExamining the dataset for additional matches, I am cross-referencing company names, registration dates, and locations. \"도서출판 일광\" is present with location specifics, alongside \"도서출판양업서원\", \"꼬꼬야\", \"비전조이\", and \"샐리북\" with respective details. Now comparing the given information against these extracted data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Search business numbers for confirmed MCST publishers","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction fetchUrl(url) {\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    https.get(url, {\n      headers: {\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\n      },\n      timeout: 8000\n    }, (res) => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(d));\n    }).on('error', () => resolve(''));\n  });\n}\n\nfunction isValidBizNo(b) {\n  if (!b) return false;\n  const clean = b.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 10) return false;\n  const weights = [1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5];\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) sum += Number(clean[i]) * weights[i];\n  const d9 = Number(clean[8]) * 5;\n  sum += Math.floor(d9 / 10) + (d9 % 10);\n  const check = (10 - (sum % 10)) % 10;\n  return check === Number(clean[9]);\n}\n\nasync function search(queries) {\n  for (const q of queries) {\n    const url = `https://search.naver.com/search.naver?where=nexearch&query=${encodeURIComponent(q)}`;\n    const html = await fetchUrl(url);\n    const matches = html.match(/\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}\\b/g) || [];\n    const valid = [...new Set(matches.filter(isValidBizNo))];\n    if (valid.length > 0) {\n      console.log(`Query [${q}] matched:`, valid);\n      for (const v of valid) {\n        const snips = html.match(new RegExp(`.{0,40}(?:${v}).{0,60}`, 'g')) || [];\n        console.log(`   Snippet:`, snips[0]);\n      }\n    }\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200));\n  }\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n  console.log('=== Searching for 샐리북 (임은선, 연제구) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"샐리북\" \"임은선\"',\n    '\"샐리북\" 연제구 사업자',\n    '\"샐리북\" 사업자등록번호',\n    '샐리북 출판사 사업자등록번호'\n  ]);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Searching for 꼬꼬야 (수영구) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"꼬꼬야\" 출판사 수영구',\n    '\"꼬꼬야\" \"251002021000019\"',\n    '\"꼬꼬야\" 출판사 사업자등록번호'\n  ]);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Searching for 나래바람 (051-612-2133, 남구 용호동 LG메트로시티) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"나래바람\" \"051-612-2133\"',\n    '\"나래바람\" \"LG메트로시티\"',\n    '\"나래바람\" 출판사 사업자',\n    '\"051-612-2133\" 사업자등록번호'\n  ]);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Searching for 도서출판 일광 (051-723-0037, 기장군 차성로344번길) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"도서출판 일광\" \"기장\"',\n    '\"051-723-0037\"',\n    '\"일광출판사\" \"기장\" 사업자'\n  ]);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Searching for 비전조이 (이구창, 해운대구) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"비전조이\" \"이구창\"',\n    '\"비전조이\" 해운대구'\n  ]);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Searching for 양업서원 (민병선, 부산진구) ===');\n  await search([\n    '\"양업서원\" \"민병선\"',\n    '\"양업서원\" 부산진구'\n  ]);\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Deep search business numbers for matched MCST publishers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\search_mcst_biznos.js","toolAction":"Create search_mcst_biznos.js","toolSummary":"Create search_mcst_biznos.js"}}]}
